      "content": "Focusing on systemic injustice actually builds unity by teaching students to recognize and dismantle the very barriers that divide communities, rather than pretending those barriers don't exist. Ignoring power struggles forces kids to accept a false narrative that ignores the reality of inequality, which breeds cynicism and apathy instead of genuine civic pride. True patriotism involves understanding how to fix broken systems, not just celebrating the past while ignoring the present struggles.",
      "source": "target",
